In case the Bidder is a Joint Venture, it shall comply with the following additional requirements:
(a) Number of members in a Joint Venture shall not exceed 3 (Three);
(b) subject to the provisions of clause (a) above, the Bid should contain the information required for each Member of the Joint Venture;
(c) Members of the Joint Venture shall nominate one member as the lead member (the "Lead Member").

(d) the Bid should include a brief description of the roles and responsibilities of individual members, particularly with reference to financial, technical and defect liability obligations;
